# Response headers for everything the Pages bundle serves itself — style.css,
# the scripts and the images. Documents never come from here: the Function
# proxies them to the origin, which sets its own CSP, nonce and cookie flags.
#
# Without this file the same site answers a page with nosniff and an asset
# without it, and the weaker half is the one a mislabelled upload reaches.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
